  "evidence": "TEXT_F: Tough law-and-order measures (more police, 10,000 CCTV cameras, curfews, minimum sentences, ending automatic early release, national crime squad), support for discipline and selection in schools, defence of national sovereignty in Europe (retain vetoes/border controls/rebate, protect opt-outs, referendum on single currency), strong armed forces with NATO central, opposition to proportional representation, managed access to land (oppose general right to roam). TEXT_C: Civil-libertarian and green agenda (written constitution and expansive Bill of Rights, PR and voting at 16, public petitions, no new censorship, full EU membership, phase-out of nuclear power and removal of nuclear weapons, stricter environmental regulation), plus some policing measures (“zero tolerance,” handgun ban) tempered by alternatives to prison.",
